<title>USA: King County, Wash., $150 mln GO bonds priced.</title>
<headline>King County, Wash., $150 mln GO bonds priced.</headline>
<text>
<p>PRELIMINARY PRICING:</p>
<p>KING COUNTY, WASHINGTON</p>
<p>RE: $150,000,000*</p>
<p>LIMITED TAX GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>1997 SERIES D</p>
<p>(BASEBALL STADIUM)</p>
<p>					   REMARKETING</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa1		   S&amp;P: AA+</p>
<p>DATED: 04/17/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 12/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 12/01</p>
<p>INTEREST ACCRUAL DATE: 5/7/97</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
